{"unit_id":"HHHHHH233333__dsh-session-delete#card-zh","repo":"HHHHHH233333/dsh-session-delete","commit":"2a181671e8f7fdf42aeda48e1dbe77da934fd782","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-session-delete 是一个面向 DSH Web 和桌面界面的会话管理插件，在侧栏会话菜单加入彻底删除入口和确认窗口。它先通过工作区注册表停止并隐藏会话，再清除本机聊天记录、标题与统计缓存、工具溢出临时文件，并在稍后补扫以处理延迟写入。确认前会预览会话数、文件数和体积，可选择是否连同派生子代理会话删除；分叉会话不自动纳入。遇到未能删除的文件时，会在界面报告失败项目。适合需要从本机清理 DSH 对话及其衍生数据的用户；不需要 API 密钥或外部服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:22-45","lib/service.js:333-390","lib/purge.js:288-392","client.js:270-317"]}
{"unit_id":"HHHHHH233333__dsh-session-delete#card-en","repo":"HHHHHH233333/dsh-session-delete","commit":"2a181671e8f7fdf42aeda48e1dbe77da934fd782","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-session-delete adds a permanent-delete action and confirmation dialog to DSH session menus. It stops and hides sessions, removes local logs, cache and temporary spill files, then runs delayed cleanup. Users can preview file counts and include spawned subagents; failed removals are reported.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:22-45","lib/service.js:333-390","lib/purge.js:288-392","client.js:270-317"]}
